{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:27d2960684cc2a53","name":"Sigma-Class Long-Range Shuttle","source":{"id":"source:reference-27d2960684cc2a53","title":"Sigma-Class Long-Range Shuttle","revision":20306,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:36:17Z","sha256":"1909573a4502a2d5d4f113348cac761b56bcf0b9665d043d0e7f175c4c83bf4b","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20306","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sigma-Class%20Long-Range%20Shuttle&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-27d2960684cc2a53","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Fel Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Fel_Empire","referenceId":"reference:45bef1c82bffe9c1"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Imperial Knights"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Imperial_Knights","referenceId":"reference:f83f5f82e44c1559"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hyperdrive"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hyperdrive","referenceId":"reference:6774bf610b6e6f09"},"-equipped long range shuttle designed for ferrying diplomats and important beings from one side of the galaxy to another, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Sigma"]},"-Class Long-Range shuttle from Sienar Fleet Systems is favored by Imperial officials who prefer to be their own pilots (or who prefer to have only a small retinue). The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Sigma"]},"-Class Long-Range Shuttle doesn't really compete with the more pervasive ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Nune"]},"-Class Imperial Shuttle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nune-Class_Imperial_Shuttle","referenceId":"reference:1ea62550133d56e9"},". While the ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Nune"]},"-Class Shuttle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nune-Class_Shuttle"}," is ideal for interplanetary travel within a given sector or region of space and often doubles as a troop transport, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Sigma"]},"-Class Shuttle is reserved for Imperial officials who need to travel across vast regions of space, such as from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Core"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Core?action=edit&redlink=1"}," to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and back again.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Most bureaucratic offices on worlds controlled by the Empire keep at least one ",{"tag":"i","children":["Sigma"]},"-Class Shuttle in good working order for the rare occasion that an official needs to travel across the galaxy. If the ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Nune"]},"-Class Imperial Shuttle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nune-Class_Imperial_Shuttle","referenceId":"reference:1ea62550133d56e9"}," is the workhorse of shuttles, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Sigma"]},"-Class is more like a luxury transport. Though not quite as extravagantly appointed as a luxury yacht, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Sigma"]},"-Class provides a comfortable environs for long-range travel, including several spacious passenger compartments, a well-stocked galley, and a large, open cargo area capable of carrying personal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeders"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeders","referenceId":"reference:be93ac2e4867f0ca"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Imperial Knights"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Imperial_Knights","referenceId":"reference:f83f5f82e44c1559"}," make extensive use of ",{"tag":"i","children":["Sigma"]},"-Class Long-Range Shuttles when